    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρηβος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥβη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>past one's prime,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.289
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>past boyhood</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρηβον, τό</span>, an Indian wood said to have magnetic
			properties, <i>peepul, Ficus religiosa</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ctes.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
